'''Journey to Talent''' is the only stage in [[Bahamut Cat's Trial]]. After clearing this [[No Continues]] stage, Bahamut Cat's Trial disappears permanently and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]'s [[Talents]] can be unlocked.

